    <string name="notif_dismiss_description">Off. When on, dismissing a mirrored notification on that computer also dismisses the original here. That is all it can do: it cannot tap a notification’s buttons, reply, open an app, or clear everything at once. Ongoing notifications are never dismissed this way.</string>
